msgid "Credits and Contributors"
msgstr "致谢与贡献者"

#: ../../source/docs/credits-and-contributors.rst:7
#: 5614785f9b754fe7b9d369abeb9487f4
msgid ""
"APM Planner 2.0 is the next generation of ground control station. It is the "
"offspring of :ref:`Mission Planner <planner:home>` and `QGround Control "
"<http://qgroundcontrol.org/>`__, combining the simple user interface of "
"Mission Planner and cross platform capability of QGround Control."
msgstr ""
"APM Planner 2.0 是下一代地面站软件，它是 :ref:`Mission Planner <planner:home>` 与 "
"`QGround Control <http://qgroundcontrol.org/>`__ 的结合，融合了 Mission Planner "
"简洁的用户界面与 QGround Control 的跨平台能力。"

#: ../../source/docs/credits-and-contributors.rst:13
#: 5ccf20eabc51420d9b4c115e92cbce30
msgid ""
"We offer a special thanks to `Michael Oborne "
"<https://diydrones.com/profiles/profile/show?id=Michaelo&>`__ and his team "
"at :ref:`Mission Planner <planner:home>` and `Lorenz Meier "
"<https://diydrones.com/profiles/profile/show?id=LorenzMeier&>`__ and the "
"team at `QGround Control <http://qgroundcontrol.org/credits>`__."
msgstr ""
"我们特别感谢 `Michael Oborne "
"<https://diydrones.com/profiles/profile/show?id=Michaelo&>`__ 及其 "
":ref:`Mission Planner <planner:home>` 团队，以及 `Lorenz Meier "
"<https://diydrones.com/profiles/profile/show?id=LorenzMeier&>`__ 和 `QGround "
"Control <http://qgroundcontrol.org/credits>`__ 团队。"

#: ../../source/docs/credits-and-contributors.rst:17
#: a34d6223f57d44ac9b359f681523a61d
msgid ""
"APM Planner 2.0 is written in `Qt <http://www.qt.io/developers/>`__, a cross"
" platform development environment that allows it to run on Windows, Mac, and"
" Linux."
msgstr ""
"APM Planner 2.0 使用 `Qt <http://www.qt.io/developers/>`__ 编写，这是一个跨平台开发环境，可在 "
"Windows、Mac 和 Linux 上运行。"

